    <briefdescription>
<para>Satisfied if the comparison selected by <computeroutput>Op</computeroutput> of two <computeroutput>const</computeroutput> objects is well-formed. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Only the requirement of the selected operator is checked, so that, for example, <computeroutput>eq()</computeroutput> accepts the types that have only an <computeroutput>operator==</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Op</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The comparison. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Lhs_T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the left hand side operand. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Rhs_T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the right hand side operand. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
